# nepriziv.ru — Project Rules

## Stack
- React 18 + TypeScript + Vite (port 8080)
- shadcn/ui (Radix UI) + Tailwind CSS — design tokens in `src/index.css`
- React Router v6, React Query v5, React Hook Form + Zod
- Supabase: PostgreSQL + Auth + Storage + Edge Functions (Deno)
- Package manager: Bun (preferred) or npm

## Critical conventions

### Auto-generated — do NOT edit manually
- `src/components/ui/` — shadcn/ui components
- `src/integrations/supabase/` — Supabase client and TypeScript types

### Path alias
`@/*` → `src/*`

### AI calls
All AI calls go through Supabase Edge Functions using `LOVABLE_API_KEY`.
Never call AI APIs directly from the frontend.

### Auth & data
- Supabase Auth (email/password + anonymous sessions)
- `user_roles` table — admin access
- `user_subscriptions` table — paid quotas
- Free demo: 3 AI questions + 3 document uploads via `useDemoMode()` + localStorage
- RLS policies enforce auth server-side — no need for client-side guards

### Edge functions
Located in `supabase/functions/`. Deploy with:
```bash
supabase functions deploy <function-name>
```
Main functions: `chat`, `analyze-medical-document`, `analyze-diagnosis`,
`generate-document`, `enhance-document`, `find-government-structures`

### Styling
- Use HSL CSS variables from `src/index.css`, not hardcoded colors
- Dark mode via `.dark` class (next-themes)
- Border radius: `0.75rem`
- Tailwind only — no inline styles

### Security
- User content must go through `src/lib/sanitize.ts` (DOMPurify) before rendering
- Validate all forms with Zod schemas from `src/lib/validations.ts`
- `.env` has public Supabase keys (safe to commit)
- Backend secrets live only in Supabase Dashboard

## Key tables
`profiles`, `user_subscriptions`, `user_roles`, `medical_documents_v2`,
`document_article_links`, `disease_articles_565`, `forum_posts`,
`forum_comments`, `blog_posts`, `testimonials`, `analytics_events`

## Commands
```bash
bun run dev      # dev server on port 8080
bun run build    # production build
npm run lint     # ESLint
```

## Deployment
- Frontend: Lovable UI (manual "Update" click required)
- Edge functions + migrations: auto-deploy on GitHub push
- Live site: https://nepriziv.ru
